        "created_at": "2012-12-05T20:55:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ahh, cool :). My online alias is a name I made up for a Fantasy story I wrote (one of many) at school for my English homework. I then decided I liked the name and started using it all over the place (hence it becoming my usual online name, even to this day, as you can see ;), and only later found out that it's a name that already exists, and means \"loyal\" in Swahili. Which is cool , 'cause as a character, it tends to be one of her major traits :D.</p>",
